    "kind": "definition_of_done",
    "summary": "- `POST /v1/plans` accepts `tiers_mode` and `tiers` for metered plans, validates them (422 `invalid_tiers` on any violation), and returns them with amounts in minor units.\n- `billing.TieredAmount` implements graduated and volume pricing, with inclusive `up_to` and zero quantity costing 0. Renewal of a tiered subscription bills one invoice line for the ended period's usage.\n- `go build ./...`, `go test ./...` and `go vet ./...` pass, and new tests cover the pricing math, plan validation and renewal billing.",
